                                "sense_id": "2223fb4d-2111-3186-a4c0-6523776bef26",
                                "text": "The Alcayde found the prince playing at chess with an Alfaqui or priest."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "da4e7198-8ad3-494f-bc84-da1749a2ccab",
                                "sense_id": "2223fb4d-2111-3186-a4c0-6523776bef26",
                                "text": "The Court of Lions was thronged with guards and courtiers and alfaquis, as in the old times of the Moors […]"
